After you register the first CMK, all data keys encrypted with the Pulumi-managed key are automatically re-encrypted with the new key; the encrypted data itself does not change. To make the key the organization default, or to disable it later, use the Customer Managed Keys tab (Set as default / Disable). Disabling requires choosing a re-encryption key.

